  e8 [verified, public, as of 2026-04-10T00:00:00-06:00] Doreen Ackley's rostered slot is 2:00 PM Monday 13 April. Her filed order intent states she will commit 4 pallets if the board shows at least 5 pallets already committed at the moment she looks, and otherwise commit nothing. (source: Filed order intent, Ackley, on file at the depot)
