  e11 [verified, public, as of 2026-04-10T00:00:00-06:00] Marisol Quinto's rostered slot is 4:00 PM Tuesday 14 April. Her filed order intent states she will commit 5 pallets if the board shows at least 15 pallets already committed at the moment she looks, and otherwise commit nothing. (source: Filed order intent, Quinto, on file at the depot)
  e12 [verified, public, as of 2026-04-10T00:00:00-06:00] Tobias Renfrew's rostered slot is 9:00 AM Wednesday 15 April. His filed order intent states he will commit 7 pallets if the board shows at least 25 pallets already committed at the moment he looks, and otherwise commit nothing. (source: Filed order intent, Renfrew, on file at the depot)
  e13 [verified, public, as of 2026-04-10T00:00:00-06:00] Greta Aldous's rostered slot is 3:00 PM Wednesday 15 April. Her filed order intent states she will commit 2 pallets if the board shows at least 20 pallets already committed at the moment she looks, and otherwise commit nothing. (source: Filed order intent, Aldous, on file at the depot)
  e14 [verified, public, as of 2026-04-10T00:00:00-06:00] Simone Ferrar's rostered slot is 5:30 PM Thursday 16 April. Her filed order intent states she will commit 9 pallets if the board shows at least 24 pallets already committed at the moment she looks, and otherwise commit nothing. (source: Filed order intent, Ferrar, on file at the depot)
  e15 [verified, public, as of 2026-04-10T00:00:00-06:00] The depot is staffed and the board is available at every rostered slot listed in this package. No grower is ill, travelling, or otherwise prevented from consulting the board at their slot. Every date and time in this package is America/Denver, which is UTC-06:00 throughout April 2026. (source: Depot staffing roster; package convention)

